    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense, but it feels like you're being a bit vague. if the mainstream media is missing these \"truths,\" doesn't that mean the populist movement is actually seeing the world more clearly than the people in charge? like, is it more accurate to say they are uncovering reality rather than just being angry?",
